# ---- Supabase (Auth) ----
# Project URL and anon/public key, from Supabase dashboard > Project Settings
# > API. The anon key is safe to ship in the client bundle by design (it can
# only do what each table's Row Level Security policy allows) -- it is NOT
# the service role key, which must never appear here.
# Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code, and only at build
# time, so these must be set wherever `npm run build` actually runs (e.g. as
# Render build-time environment variables for the client), not just locally.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
